IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CLM0011.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY CLM0011C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 F-UI               PIC X VALUE 'N'.
        88 F-REFERRED VALUE 'Y'.
    05 WS-CLST            PIC X VALUE 'A'.
        88 CLST-INVESTIGATE VALUE 'I'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM 3000-AUTO-REPORT
    PERFORM 3100-CLAIM-FREQ
    DISPLAY "F-UI=" F-UI
    DISPLAY "WS-CLST=" WS-CLST
    STOP RUN.
3000-AUTO-REPORT.
    IF CT-AUTO AND PR-IS-N AND C-VL > 5000
        MOVE 'Y' TO F-UI
        SET CLST-INVESTIGATE TO TRUE
    END-IF.
3100-CLAIM-FREQ.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 1996
    *>  IF WS-PCLM >= 3
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    IF WS-PCLM >= 4
        SET F-REFERRED TO TRUE
    END-IF.
